                  prāṇālaya iti prāhuḥ pādāṅguṣṭhe'pi kecana |
                  apānayatyapāno'yamāhārañca malāyitam ||
                  śukraṃ mūtraṃ tathotsargamapānastena mārutaḥ |
                  indragopapratīkāśaḥ sandhyājaladasannibhaḥ ||
                  sa ca meḍhre ca pāyau ca ūruvaṅkṣaṇajānuṣu |
                  jaṅghodare kṛkāṭyāñca nābhimūle ca tiṣṭhati ||
                  vyāno vyānaśayatyannaṃ sarvavyādhiprakopanaḥ |
                  mahārajatasuprakhyo hānopādānakārakaḥ ||
                  sa cākṣikarṇayormadhye kāṭyāṃ vai gulphayorapi |
                  ghrāṇe gale sphiguddeśe tiṣṭhatyatra nirantaram ||
