                  udagdakṣiṇago matsyo rekhāyāṃ jāyate kramāt |
                  śapharasya mukhe pucche madhyacihne prasāritam ||
                  samantāt somasūtraṃ syāt |
 iti || 4 ||
dvābhyāṃ dvābhyāṃ tathā'grābhyāṃ koṇeṣu makarān likhet       |
matsyamadhye   sthitāgrāṇi   tatra   sūtrāṇi   pātayet       || 5 ||
      dvābhyāmiti |
