                  kṛtāñjalipuṭāḥ sarve khaḍgakheṭakapāṇayaḥ |
                  brahmāṇaṃ saṃnirīkṣante tadvaktrābhimukhāśca te ||
                  svasvasthāne sthitāścaiva sādhāraṇamudāhṛtam |
                  marīciḥ śvetavarṇaḥ syād vivasvān rakta(abhra)varṇakaḥ ||
                  śātakumbhasamo(nabho)mitraḥ kṛṣṇavarṇastu bhūdharaḥ |
                  savitā nīlavarṇābhaḥ sāvitro dhūmravigrahaḥ ||
                  indraścāruṇavarṇābhaḥ śuklaścendrajayastathā |
                  rudraḥ pravālasadṛśaḥ pīto rudrayastathā ||
                  āpo gokṣīradhavala āpavatso japādyutiḥ |
                  īśānaḥ kṣīradhavalaḥ parjanyo'ñjanasannibhaḥ ||
                  jayanto'ñjanasaṅkāśo mahendraścāḥ(śyā)maladyutiḥ |
                  ādityo raktavarṇaḥ syāt satyakaścitravarṇakaḥ ||
                  vṛṣo vandhūkapuṣpābhaḥ kundābhaścāntarikṣakaḥ |
                  udyaddinakarābho'gniḥ pūṣā raktābjasannibhaḥ ||
                  vitathaścendracāpābho vidyudvarṇe gṛhakṣataḥ |
                  yamaścāñjanasaṅkāśo gandharvaḥ padmarāgavat ||
                  bhṛṅgarājaśca bhṛṅgābho mṛgo jīmūtasannibhaḥ |
                  nirṛtiḥ pāvakābhaśca pīto dauvārikaḥ smṛtaḥ ||
                  sagrīvo nīlakaṇṭhābhaścandrābhaḥ puṣpadantakaḥ |
                  varuṇaḥ sphaṭikabhāṅgo bhṛṅgābhaścāsuro mataḥ ||
                  śe(śo)ṣaścotpalasaṅkāśaḥ pāpayakṣme(rogaścaive)ndranīlavat |
                  vāyuḥ kṛṣṇābhavarṇaḥ syānnāgaḥ śaṅkhendusannibhaḥ ||
                  mukhyo mauktikasaṅkāśo bhallāṭaḥ śvetapadmavat |
                  somaḥ sphaṭikasaṅkāśo'rgalo raktotpaladyutiḥ ||
                  ditiḥ kundendudhavalā kapilā cāditiḥ smṛtā |
                  carakī śaṅkhasaddaśī vidārī pāvakadyutiḥ ||
                  pūtanā himasaṅkāśā meghābhā pilapicchikā |
                  khaḍgañca pānapātrañca churikāṃ karttarīṃ tathā ||
                  dadhānā bhīmarūpāstā rākṣasyaḥ parikīttītāḥ |
                  sito raktaśca pītaśca kṛṣṇaḥ skandādikā grahāḥ ||
                  vajraṃ śaktiñca khaḍgañca pāśañca vikṛtānanāḥ |
                  dadhānā bhīṣaṇāḥ proktā grahāḥ skandādikāśca te || iti |
