 iti |
          tathā(----)      kṣīraṃ khaṇḍasamāyuktaṃ puṣpādibhiralaṅkṛtam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamāpa śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||
                  dadhīdaṃ guḍasaṃmiśraṃ gandhādivastumaṇḍitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ vatsa vighnamatra praṇāśaya ||
                  puṣpādikuśapānīyaṃ karpūrāguruvāsitam |
                  sāvitra vai gṛhāṇemaṃ śāntimatra prayaccha me ||
                  piṣṭakaṃ saguḍaṃ nātha raktagandhādiśobhitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ sūrya vighnamatra praṇāśaya ||
                  śītamannaṃ tathā puṣpaṃ kuṅkumādisamanvitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ śakradeva namo'stu te ||
                  odanaṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ vastragandhādimaṇḍitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamindrajaya namo'stu te ||
                  pakvāpakvamidaṃ māṃsaṃ vastrapuṣpādisaṃyutam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ rudradeva namāmyaham ||
                  hṛnmāṃsaṃ(samāṃsaṃ) saghṛtaṃ pakvaṃ gandhapuṣpādisaṃyutam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ rudrajaya svasti prayaccha me ||
                  raktapuṣpaṃ samāṃsaṃ vai raktavastrādisaṃyutam |
                  vidāri vai gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ vināśaya ||
                  pittaṃ raktāsthisaṃyuktaṃ raktagandhādimaṇḍitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ pāpe (pūtane tvaṃ) rakṣovighnaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  saghṛtaṃ māṣa(māṃsa) bhaktañca vastragandhādyalaṅkṛtam |
                  baliṃ gṛhāṇa śarvemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  māṃsaṃ puṣpādisaṃyuktaṃ māṣabhaktopaśobhitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ skanda rakṣovighnaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  śvamāṃsa (surasaṃ) piṣṭakairyuktaṃ pakvamāṃsodakānvitam |
                  aryaman vai gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  raktamāṃsaudanaṃ matsyaṃ gandhadhūpasamanvitam |
                  jṛmbhaka tvaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  chāgakarṇānvitaṃ māṃsaṃ vastragandhādisaṃyutam |
                  pilipiccha gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  ghṛtena sādhitaṃ māṃsaṃ vastragandhādisaṃyutam |
                  caraki vai gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  saghṛtaṃ cākṣatānnañca vastragandhādyalaṅkṛtam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ balintvīśa vāstudoṣāpahārakam ||
                  utpalaṃ pāyasairyuktaṃ vastrādikasamanvitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ deva(megha)rāja namo'stu te ||
                  pañcahastaṃ supītañca dhvajaṃ bhaktādimaṇḍitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ jiṣṇusuta namo'stu te ||
                  odanaṃ ghṛtasampūrṇaṃ pañcaratnādimaṇḍitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ (deva) devarāja namo'stu te ||
                  raktapuṣpayutaṃ bhaktaṃ raktagandhādibhiryatam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ bhāskara tvaṃ namo'stu te ||
                  vitānaṃ dhūmravarṇābhaṃ gandhādikasuśobhitam |
                  vastrayuktaṃ (raktapuṣpaṃ) gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ satya namo'stu te ||
                  idantu māṃsabhaktaṃ vai vastragandhādipūjitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ vṛṣa baliṃ vāstudoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  idantu śādvalaṃ māṃsaṃ naivedyādisusaṃyutam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ vyoma śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||
                  suvarṇaṃ piṣṭakañcātha vastragandhādibhiryatam |
                  ghṛtānvitaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ saptajihva namo'stu te ||
                  kṣīraṃ lājasamāyuktaṃ raktapuṣpādimaṇḍitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ pūṣadeva namo'stu te ||
                  dadhigandhādibhiryuktaṃ pītapuṣpasamanvitam |
                  baliṃ vitatha gṛhṇemaṃ vighnamatra praṇāśaya ||
                  bhaktaṃ madhuplutaṃ caiṇaṃ raktavastrādimaṇḍitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ yamadeva namo'stu te ||
                  pakvamāṃsaudanaṃ navanītaṃ vastrādimaṇḍitam |
                  prītikaraṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ gṛharakṣa namo'stu te ||
                  nānāgandhasamāyuktaṃ raktapuṣpādibhiryutam |
                  baliṃ gṛhāṇa gandharva sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  imāntu śākunīṃ jihvāṃ māṣabhaktoparisthitām |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ bhṛṅgarāja śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||
                  yavaṃ ghṛtatilopetaṃ gandhapuṣpādisaṃyutam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ mṛgadeva namo'stu te ||
                  śarkarāsaṃyutaṃ khaṇḍaṃ vastragandhādimaṇḍitam |
                  prīti baliṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣorāja namo'stu te ||
                  candanāgurukāṣṭhañca gandhapuṣpādibhiryutam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ dauvārika namo'stu te ||
                  idantu pāyasaṃ nātha gandhapuṣpādimaṇḍitam |
                  sugrīva vai gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||
                  yavā(grāṇi)nnāni ca godugdhaṃ bhaktopari suropitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ jalarāja namo'stu te ||
                  māṣabha(yu)ktaṃ kuśastambaṃ ghṛtagandhādisaṃyutam |
                  puṣpadanta gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  madhunā sādhitaṃ piṣṭaṃ gandhādyairupaśobhitam |
                  baliṃ gṛhāṇāsurendra sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  ghṛtañcā'nnasamāyuktaṃ karpūrādisuvāsitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ śeṣa(śoṣa)sarvaśāntiṃ prayaccha me ||
                  yavajaṃ taṇḍulaṃ nātha gandhapuṣpādiśobhitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ roga sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  saghṛtaṃ maṇḍaka(modaka)ñcedamannādyairupaśobhitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ mṛgavāha namo'stu te ||
                  idañca kṛśaraṃ cānnaṃ puṣpagandhādimaṇḍitam |
                  pātāleśa gṛhāṇemaṃ vighnamatra praṇaśyatu ||
                  nārikelodakaṃ bhaktaṃ pītavastrādisaṃyutam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ mukhya vāstudoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  pāyasaṃ madhunā miśraṃ nānāpūjo(pītapuṣpo)paśobhitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ soma sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  odanaṃ ghṛtasaṃmiśraṃ gandhapuṣpasamanvitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ bhallāṭa tvaṃ namo'stu te ||
                  māṣānnañca ghṛtābhyaktaṃ puṣpagandhādimaṇḍitam |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamargalākhya namo'stu te ||
                  kṣīraṃ khaṇḍasamāyuktaṃ nānāpūjo(puṣpo)paśobhitam |
                  daityamātargṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||
                  polikāṃ madhusaṃyuktāṃ gandhavastrādisaṃyutām |
                  gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ devamātarnamo'stu te ||
                  svargapātālamartyeṣu ye devā vāstusambhavāḥ |
                  gṛhṇantvamuṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ tuṣṭā yāntu svamandiram ||
                  mātaro bhūtavetālā ye cānye balikāṃkṣiṇaḥ |
                  viṣṇoḥ pariṣadā ye ca te'pi gṛhṇantvimaṃ balim ||
                  pitṛbhyaḥ kṣetrapālebhyo baliṃ dattvā prakāmataḥ |
                  abhāvāduktamārgasya kuśapuṣpādibhiryajet || iti |
