                  āgneyādikrameṇaiva |
 iti |
tena bahirdvādaśastambhasthāpanamapi āgneyādikrameṇeti jñeyam |
 taduktam(----)
                  stambhocchrāye śilānyāse sūtrayojanakīlake |
                  khananāvaṭa saṃskāre prārambho vahnigocare || iti ||
      te ca aṣṭahastasamucchrāyāḥ |
 stambhoccatvaṃ vadatā granthakṛtā ṣoḍaśahastasyaivotta(-) matvamuktam |
      yat pañcarātre(----)maṇḍapārddhecchiratān vedasaṃkhyāṃścūḍānvitāṃstathā |
 iti |
