                        prathamaṃ tat pramāṇānāṃ trasareṇuṃ pracakṣate ||
                        trasareṇustu vijñeyo hyaṣṭau te paramāṇavaḥ |
                        trasareṇava ete syuraṣṭareṇustu saṃsmṛtaḥ ||
                        te reṇavastathā tvaṣṭau bālāgraṃ tat smṛtaṃ budhaiḥ |
                        bālāgrāṇyaṣṭa likhyā tu yūkā likhyāṣṭakaṃ smṛtam ||
                        aṣṭau yūkā yavaṃ prāhuraṅgulantu yavāṣṭakam |
                        ratnistvaṅgulaparvāṇi vijñeyastvekaviṃśatiḥ ||
                        catvāri viṃśatiścaiva hastaḥ syādaṅgulāni tu || iti |
aṅguladvayamekatayaivoktam |
 trailokyasāre'pi(----)
