tribhirapavattītaḥ sa evāṅkaḥ |
 tato  (") vyāsasya varga (")  ityādiprakāreṇa labdhaṃ kṣetraphalaṃ pañcaśatī aṣṭādhikāni pañcāśad aṅgulāni |
