                        bahirnyasya bhramānmadhyād vṛttaṃ kuṇḍamitīritam ||
      atra sārddhāṃśamekamaṅgulaṃ catvāro yavāḥ ekasya pañcaviṃśāṃśāḥ (2) yūke (4) likhyā arddhasahitāḥ |
 vṛtte kṛte etadviguṇaṃ (3) aṅgulāni (0) yavāḥ (5) yūkāḥ (1) likhyā |
 tena sarvasya vyāsasya nyāsaḥ (27) ayaṃ savaṇītaḥ   (") vyāsasya varge bhanavāgni (")  ityādinā labdhaṃ kṣetraphalaṃ (576) |
