      caturasraṃ maṇḍalaṃ cikīrṣan madhyādaṃśe nipātya pārśvataḥ parilikhya tatra yadatiriktaṃ bhavati tasya 
tṛtīyena saha maṇḍalaṃ parilikhet samādhiḥ |
 iti |
      atrāṃśaśabdena koṇaḥ |
