ṣaṭtriṃśatā padairmadhye likhet padmaṃ sa(su)lakṣaṇam       |
bahiḥ paṅktyā bhavet pīṭhaṃ paṅktiyugmena  vīthikā       || 108 ||
dvāraśobhopaśobhāstrān śiṣṭābhyāṃ parikalpayet       |
śāstroktavidhinā  mantrī tataḥ padmaṃ samālikhet       || 109 ||
