 kakkolaṃ kośaphalam kavāva iti kānyakubja(-) bhāṣāyām |
 taduktamagastisaṃhitāyām(----)
                  tathā''camanapātre'pi dadyājjātīphalaṃ mune |
                  lavaṅgamapi kakkolaṃ śastamācamanīyakam || iti |
                  mahākapilapañcarātre ācamanīyadravyāṇyanyathoktāni |
                  karpūramaguruṃ puṣpaṃ dravyāṇyācamanīyakam |
 iti |
  anyatra viśeṣaḥ(----)      arghyaṃ trirdadāti(,) pādyaṃ trirdadāti(,) ācamanīyaṃ ṣaḍdadāti |
 iti |
                  āgatāya tathārcāyāṃ snātumāsanagāya ca |
                  pūjāto gantukāmasya dadyādarghyaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ ||
                  āgate snānakāle ca naivedyopakrame tathā |
                  pādyasyāpi samuddiṣṭaḥ samayastrividho budhaiḥ |
 iti || 94 ||
arghyaṃ diśettato  mūddhna śiromantreṇa deśikaḥ       |
gandhapuṣpākṣatayavakuśāgratilasarṣapaiḥ       || 95 ||
sadūrvaiḥ         sarvadevānāmetadarghyamudīritam       |
sudhāṇunā   tataḥ  kuryānmadhuparkaṃ  mukhāmbuje       || 96 ||
ājyaṃ    dadhimadhūnmiśrametaduktaṃ   manīṣibhiḥ       |
tenaiva     manunā    kuryādadbhirācamanīyakam       || 97 ||
