gandhādbhiriti |
 taduktaṃ mantratantraprakāśe(----)
                  śuddhatoyād gandhatoyaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ śataguṇottaram |
                  gaṅgāditīrthatoyānāṃ phalaṃ śāstrapraṇoditam ||
tatra tatrādhigantavyam |
 iti |
 tathā(----)
                  nāharenmalinaṃ toyaṃ keśakīṭādidūṣitam |
