etadanantaraṃ śaṅkhajalena devatāyā'bhiṣekaṃ kuryāt |
 yadāhuḥ(----)
                  śataṃ sahasramayutaṃ śaktyā caivābhiṣecayet |
                  śaṅkhaṃ sampūrya tenaiva sapuṣpeṇa ca devatām || iti |
      anyatrāpi(----)      a(sva)śaktyā gandhatoyena saṃsnāpya jagadīśvaram |
 iti |
    atra viśeṣaḥ(----)      mahābhiṣekaṃ sarvatra śaṅkhenaiva prakalpayet |
