aṅgaspṛṣṭaṃ  samāghrātaṃ  tyajet  paryuṣitaṃ  guruḥ       |
devasya mastakaṃ  kuryāt  kusumopahitaṃ sadā       || 105 ||
      gandhādyairityuktaṃ tatsvarūpamevāha gandha ityādinā |
 ślokastu(----)
                  paramānandasaurabhyaparipūrṇadigantara |
