                  caturthaṃ saptamaṃ varṇaṃ rānulomena saṃsthitam ||
                  caturthaṃ thānulomena tṛtīyaṃ gavilomataḥ |
                  svaropāntyasvanāmābhyāṃ bheditaṃ sarvameva tat ||
                  anupūrveddhataṃ bījaṃ brahmāntaṃ vāsavādimam || iti |
etāni dīrghāṇyapīti kecit |
