 iti |
 atrāpi tāraśabdārthaḥ pūrvavat |
  (") raṃ vahnicaitanyāya namaḥ (")  iti padmapādācāryāḥ |
 anye tu tāraśabdena hū(/)kāraṃ mantraśabdena vahnicaitanyāya namaḥ (")  ityāhuḥ |
