       (") mukhye puṣpāñjaliṃ kṛtvā gaṇeśābhyarcanaṃ bhavet (")  ityukteḥ śaktimantrānuktvā kramaprāptān 
gaṇapatimantrān vaktumupakramate atheti |
      sarvārthasiddhidāniti viniyogoktiḥ || 1 ||
