      yantramāha madhya iti |
 dahanapurayuge parasparavyatibhinne ṣaṭkoṇe madhye vyadhikaraṇe saptamyau |
 tatra satāraṃ sapraṇavaṃ sādhyasādhakanāmakarmasahitaṃ bījaṃ vakṣyamāṇaṃ vārāhaṃ likhet |
 atra tāraḥ cakramantrastha iti jñeyam |
 ṣaḍasreṣu ṣaṭkoṇeṣu |
