                  kalau caturguṇā proktā munibhirnāradādibhiḥ || iti ||
                  saṃkhyāpūrttau nijairdravyairjapasaṃkhyādaśāṃśataḥ |
                  yathoktakuṇḍe juhuyādyathāvidhi samāhitaḥ ||
                  athavā pratyahaṃ japtvā juhuyāttaddaśāṃśataḥ |
                  tato homadaśāṃśaṃ tu jale sampūjya devatām ||
                  tarpayāmīti mantrānte proktvā'dbhirmūdhni tarpayet |
