                  praṇāmaṃ mantrataḥ kuryāt pūrvapūrvadaśāṃśataḥ |
                  tadante mahatīṃ pūjāṃ kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam ||
                  guruṃ santoṣayedevaṃ mantrāḥ sidhyanti mantriṇaḥ |
                  itthaṃ puraścaraṇataḥ prasannā devatā bhavet ||
                  daśāṅgopāsanaṃ bhaktyā puraścaraṇamucyate |
                  japo homastarpaṇaṃ ca pūjā brāhmaṇabhojanam ||
                  pūrvapūrvadaśāṃśena kuryātpañcāṅgasaṃyutam |
                  yadyadaṅgaṃ vihīyeta tatsaṃkhyādviguṇo japaḥ ||
                  karttavyaścā'ṅgasiddhyarthaṃ tadaśaktena bhaktitaḥ |
 iti ||
mantratantraprakāśe'pi(----)asambhave tu homasya homāt syād dviguṇo japaḥ |
 iti ||
      anyatrāpi(----)      homakarmaṇyaśaktānāṃ viprāṇāṃ dviguṇo japaḥ |
