                  sarvathā bhojayedviprān kṛtasāṅgatvasiddhaye |
                  viprārādhanamātreṇa vyaṅgaṃ sāṅgaṃ bhavet sadā ||
                  nyūnātiriktakarmāṇi na phalanti manorathān |
                   tānyeva pūrṇatāṃ yānti samastāni kṛtāni ca ||
                  ato yatnena viduṣo bhojayet sarvakarmasu |
                  yāni yānyapi karmāṇi hīyante dvijabhojanaiḥ |
                  nirarthakāni tāni syurbījānyūṣaragāṇi ca || iti ||
