                   grahaṇādi tu mokṣāntaṃ japenmantraṃ samāhitaḥ ||
                  anantaraṃ taddaśāṃśakramāddhomādikaṃ caret |
                  tadante mantrasiddhyarthaṃ guruṃ sampūjya toṣayet ||
                  tataśca mantrasiddhiḥ syād devatā ca prasīdati |
                  athavā devatārūpaṃ guruṃ bhaktyā pratoṣayet ||
                  puraścaraṇahīno'pi mantraḥ siddhenna saṃśayaḥ |
                   evaṃ sādhitamantrastu kāmyakarmāṇyathācaret || iti ||
      anyatrāpi(----)      upadeśasya sāmarthyācchrīgurośca prasādataḥ |
                   mantraprabhāvādbhaktyā ca mantrasiddhiḥ prajāyate ||
