tathā vaiśampāyanasaṃhitāyām(----)puraścaraṇasampanno mantro hi phaladāyakaḥ |
                   kiṃ homaiḥ kiṃ japaiścaiva kiṃ mantranyāsavistaraiḥ ||
                  rahasyānāṃ ca mantrāṇāṃ yadi na syāt puraskriyā |
                   puraskriyā   tu  mantrāṇāṃ  pradhānaṃ bījamucyate ||
                  vyādhigrasto yathā dehī sarvakarmasu na kṣamaḥ |
                  puraścaraṇahīno'yaṃ tathā mantro'pi kīttītaḥ ||
                  yeṣāṃ jape ca home ca saṃkhyā noktā manīṣibhiḥ |
                  teṣāmaṣṭasahasrāṇi saṃkhyoktā japahomayoḥ ||
                  yasmiṃśca nigadenaiva mantre saṃkhyā'bhidhīyate |
                  tatra sarvatra mantrāṇāṃ saṃkhyāvṛddhiryugakramāt ||
                  kalpoktā ca kṛte saṃkhyā tretāyāṃ dviguṇā bhavet |
                  dvāpare triguṇā proktā kalau saṃkhyā caturguṇā ||
                  anukte tu havirdravye tilājyaṃ havirucyate |
                  śākaṃ mūlaṃ phalaṃ bhaikṣyaṃ haviṣyaṃ saktavo'thavā ||
                  athavā kṣīramātraṃ syāt puraścarttuśca vṛttaye |
                  na seveta striyaṃ māṃsaṃ madhuṃ vā mantrasādhakaḥ ||
                  etāni sevamānasya na sidhyati puraskirayā |
                  striyaṃ śūdraṃ na bhāṣeta puraścaraṇakṛnnaraḥ ||
                  japaṃ ca prātarārabhya kuryān madhyandināvadhi |
                  asatyaṃ nābhibhāṣeta nendriyāṇi pralobhayet ||
                  nairantaryavidhiḥ prokto na dinaṃ vyatilaṅghayet |
                  divasātikramāt puṃso mantrasiddhirbhaven na hi ||
                  śaktihīnaśca yo mantro na sidhyati kadācana |
                  yāvatsaṃkhyaṃ japedahni pūrvasmiṃstāvadeva tu ||
                  dināntare'pi prajapedanyathā siddhirodhakṛt |
                  śivasya sannidhāne tu sūryāgnyośca gurorapi ||
                  dīpasya jvalitasyāpi japakarma praśasyate |
                  śayanaṃ kuśaśayyāyāṃ vinyasecchucivastradhṛk ||
                  tadvāsaḥ kṣālayen nityamanyathā vighnabhāgbhavet |
                  snānaṃ triṣavaṇaṃ proktamaśaktyā dviḥ sakṛttu vā ||
                  asnātasya phalaṃ nāsti na cā'tarpayataḥ pitṛn |
                  nā'pyatarpayato devān nā'satyamapi jalpataḥ ||
                  naikavāsā japen mantraṃ bahuvastrāvṛto'pi vā |
                  viparyāsaṃ na kuryācca kadācidapi mohataḥ ||
                  uparyadho bahirvastre puraścaraṇakṛdbudhaḥ |
                  viniyogavidhāne tu bhavedaniyamaḥ kvacit ||
                  puraścaraṇakāryeṣu varjayettaṃ prayatnataḥ |
                   kṛtvā mantrajapaṃ mantrī puraskārāya saṃyataḥ ||
                  daśāṃśaṃ juhuyādagnau yathoktavidhinā budhaḥ |
                  yadvā japacaturthāṃśaṃ svāhāntaṃ mantramuccaran ||
                  tato homadaśāṃśaṃ tu svāhāntaṃ tarpayejjalaiḥ |
                  tarpaṇasya daśāṃśena namo'ntaṃ mantramuddharet ||
                  abhiṣiñcett svamūrddhānaṃ jalaiḥ kumbhākhyamudrayā |
                  evaṃvidhavidhānena kṛtamantrapuraskriyaḥ ||
                   viniyogasamārabhyaṃ yathāyathamathācaret |
 iti |
