 evametadyantralikhanaṃ svagurusampradāyānusāreṇa boddhavya(-) miti saṃkṣepaḥ |
 aṣṭākṣara pravidabhītān pādān koṣṭhacatuṣṭayasthān prathamadvitīyaṣaṣṭha(-) saptamasthān likhet |
