                  vidyākapālaparighamaṇḍitabāhukhaṇḍam || iti || 85-86 ||
pūrvekte  prayajetpīṭhe mūttīṃ  mūlena  kalpayet       |
āvāhya  pūjayettasyāṃ  mūrttyādyāvaraṇaiḥ  saha       || 87 ||
śaktiṃ  ḍamarukābhītivarān  sandadhataṃ  karaiḥ       |
īśānaṃ trīkṣaṇaṃ śubhramaiśānyāṃ  diśi pūjayet       || 88 ||
paraśveṇavarābhītirdadhānaṃ     vidyudujjvalam       |
caturmukhaṃ   tatpuruṣaṃ   trinetraṃ  pūrvato'rcayet       || 89 ||
akṣasrajaṃ   mṛgapāśau  sṛṇiṃ  ḍamarukaṃ  tataḥ       |
khaṭvāṅgaṃ niśitaṃ śūlaṃ kapālaṃ bibhrataṃ karaiḥ       || 90 ||
añjanābhaṃ  caturvaktraṃ   bhīmadaṃṣṭraṃ  bhayāvaham       |
aghoraṃ   trīkṣaṇaṃ  yāmye  pūjayenmantravittamaḥ       || 91 ||
kuṅkumābhaṃ caturvaktraṃ vāmadevaṃ trilocanam       |
varābhayākṣavalayakuṭhāraṃ     dadhataṃ     karaiḥ       || 92 ||
vilāsinaṃ smeravaktraṃ saumye samyak samarcayet       |
karpūrendunibhaṃ  saumyaṃ  sadyojātaṃ  trilocanam       || 93 ||
hariṇākṣaguṇābhītivarahastaṃ       caturmukham       |
bālenduśekharollāsi  mukuṭaṃ paścime yajet       || 94 ||
      mūrttīti |
 ādiśabdenā'ṅgāvṛtiruktā |
 mūrttyāvaraṇaṃ ca aṅgāvaraṇaṃ ca āvaraṇāni anantomendravajrādīni ca taiḥ mūrttyādyāvaraṇairityekaśeṣeṇa samāsaḥ kāryaḥ |
 tena mūttī(-) pañcakanivṛttyādipañcakena prathamāvaraṇaṃ sampūjya dvitīyāṅgaistṛtīyā vidyeśvarādibhirityarthaḥ|
 taduktaṃ prayogasāre(----) (") mūrtyaṅgāvaraṇopetam (")  iti |
 anyatrāpi mūttīpūjāmuktvā uktam(----)
                  āgneyeśānanairṛtyavāyupatreṣvatho paraḥ |
                  saṃpūjyā'ṅgāni coktāni dikṣvastramapi pūjayet ||
                  svanāmakalitairmantrairanantaṃ sūkṣmameva ca |
 ityādinā |
      vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāmapi(----)pūjayetparameśvaram |
 brahmabhiśca ṣaḍaṅgaiśca |
 iti |
 padma(-) pādācāryairapi mūrttyāvaraṇādbahiraṅgāvaraṇaṃ draṣṭavyamityuktam |
 tena yat kecana mūrttyāvaraṇāt pūrvam aṅgāvaraṇaṃ vadanti tadayuktam |
 nārāyaṇīye'pi(----)mūrttyāṅgāni yajedyathāvidhi |
 iti |
 pūrvata ityādi diggrahaṇaṃ nyakkṛtā prasiddhadiśāmeva kṛtamiti jñeyam  |
 mantravittamaḥ samyak samarcayedityaneneśādīnāṃ nyāsoktabījāditvena pūjaye(-) dityuktaṃ bhavati || 87-94 ||
nivṛttyādyāstataḥ koṇe tejorūpāḥ kalāḥ kramāt       |
kesareṣu ṣaḍaṅgāni  pūrvavat  pūjayet  sudhīḥ       || 95 ||
vidyeśvarānanantādyān patreṣu  parito  yajet       |
umādikāstato bāhye śakrādyānāyudhaiḥ saha       || 96 ||
iti sampūjya deveśaṃ  bhaktyā paramayā yutaḥ       |
prīṇayennṛtyagītādyaiḥ  stotrairmantrī   manoharaiḥ       || 97 ||
      tejorūpā iti |
 eṣāṃ śarīrādyākārābhāve kāraṇamuktamācāryaiḥ(----)
                  bhūtānāṃ śaktitvādvyāptatvājjagati vā nivṛttyādyāḥ |
                  tejorūpāḥ karapadavarṇavihīnā manīṣibhiḥ proktāḥ || iti ||
      tantrāntare ākāro'pyuktaḥ |
                  vajrākṣamālāmabhayamambujaṃ bibhratī karaiḥ |
                  hemābhā cārusarvāṅgā nivṛttiḥ sitabhūṣaṇā ||
                  śvetākalpā'kṣamālābjapāśābhayakarā sitā |
                   sarvābharaṇasandīptā pratiṣṭhā'timanoharā ||
                  śaktyakṣamālābjābhītihastā guñjāruṇojjvalā |
                  kapardendustrikamukhī dhyeyā vidyā kalā tridṛk ||
                  caturvaktrabhujā kṛṣṇā nīlavastrā kapadīnī |
                   dhvajākṣamālābjābhītihastā śāntikalā tridṛk ||
                  sphaṭikābhā pañcavaktrā vedākṣasragvarābhayān |
                  dadhatī sakapardenduḥ śāntyatītā'cchabhūṣaṇā || iti |
      kalā ityanena prathamapaṭaloktāpañcīkṛtabhūtabījādyā ityuktam |
 kramādityane(-) naitaduktam |
 āgneyādiṣu nivṛttyādi catuṣkaṃ saṃpūjya īśasthāne śāntyatītāṃ pūrvameva pūjayediti |
 anye tu īśānaśāntyatīte madhye pūjayedityāhuḥ |
 prapañcasārasammatametat |
 pūrvamūrdhvaprāgityuktvā paścāt pūrvektadikṣu mūrttīrityukteḥ |
 anye tvevaṃ tayoḥ pūjāmāhuḥ |
 umādikā iti pūrvavaduttarādi yajet |
 asya tantrāntarasthaṃ yantradvayamucyate(----)
                  ṣaṭkoṇamaṇḍalaṃ bāhye rocanācandanāktayā |
                  dūrvayā vilikhenmantrī prāsādaṃ nāmasaṃyutam ||
                  bahiḥ ṣaṭsu ca koṇeṣu praṇavādyaṃ ṣaḍakṣaram |
                  trayastriṃśaddalaṃ bāhye tristriṃśadvarṇamālikhet ||
                  īśānavarṇaṣaṭkaṃ ca tatpuruṣaṃ tu saptakam |
                  aghoravarṇaṣaṭkaṃ ca vāmadevasya saptakam ||
                  sadyojātaṃ tathā sapta namo'ntaṃ varṇamālikhet |
                  mṛtyuñjayena saṃveṣṭya dhārayedyantramuttamam || iti |
                  ṣaṭkoṇāntaḥ sādhyayuktaṃ prāsādaṃ mūlamasriṣu |
                  sandhiṣvaṅgāni tadvāhye padmaṃ pañcadalaṃ tviha ||
                  īśānādyāḥ pañcamūrttīrṅekṛdantā likhettataḥ |
                  aṣṭapatraṃ mātṛkāṣṭavargayuktaṃ likhedvahiḥ ||
                  saṃveṣṭyā'nuṣṭubhā yantraṃ japahomādisādhitam |
                  ārogyāyuḥ sutaiśvarya caturvargaphalapradam || iti || 95-97 ||
tāro māyā viyad bindumanusvarasamanvitam       |
pañcākṣarasamāyukto    vasuvarṇe    manurmataḥ       || 98 ||
      aṣṭākṣaraṃ prāsādamantramāha tāra iti |
 tāraḥ praṇavaḥ |
 māyā śaktibījam |
 viyat haḥ bindumanusvarau auṃ tadyuk tena hauṃ |
 pañcākṣara iti śaivapañcākṣaraḥ |
 vasuvarṇe'ṣṭākṣaraḥṃ pūrvekte ṛṣichandasī |
 umāpatirdevatā || 98 ||
pañcākṣaroktavat kuryādaṅganyāsādikaṃ budhaḥ || 99 ||
      pañcākṣaroktavaditi |
 māyāṣaḍdīrghādyabījaṣaḍakṣaraiḥ ṣaḍaṅgamiti saṃpradāyavidaḥ |
 ādiśabdena mūttīpañcakanyāsaḥ || 99 ||
vande   sindūravarṇaṃ  maṇimukuṭalasaccārucandrāvataṃsaṃ
