vṛttottuṅgastanāgre   nihitakaratalaṃ    vedaṭaṅkeṣṭahastam || 100 ||
aṣṭalakṣaṃ  japedenaṃ  manuṃ   manuvidāṃ    varaḥ       |
tatsahasraṃ   prajuhuyāt    pāyasānnairghṛtaplutaiḥ       || 101 ||
