aṅgairāvaraṇaṃ         pūrvamanantādyairanantaram       || 102 ||
umādibhiḥ samuddaṣṭaṃ tṛtīyaṃ  lokanāyakaiḥ       |
caturthaṃ  pañcamaṃ  teṣāmāyudhaiḥ  parikīttītam       || 103 ||
evaṃ   pratidinaṃ   devaṃ   pūjayetsādhakottamaḥ       |
putramitrādisahitāṃ   śriyaṃ   prāpya  pramodate       || 104 ||
