[athaikaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ]

atha gāyatrīprakaraṇam
atho vakṣyāmi gāyatrīṃ tattvarūpāṃ trayīmayīm       |
yayā  prakāśyate brahma  saccidānandalakṣaṇam       || 1 ||
      evaṃ tāntrikān pañcadevatāmantrānuktvā katicidgāyatryādivaidikānmantrānvaktu(-) mupakramate atho iti |
 tattvarūpāṃ catuvīṃśativarṇānāṃ catuvīṃśatitattvātmatvāttadrūpatā |
 tānyakṣaranyāse vakṣyante |
 anena gāyatryakṣaraiḥ sārddhaṃ tattvanyāso'pi sūcitaḥ |
 trayīmayīmityanena etayā samyagyathāvidhi paṭhitayā trayīpāṭhaphalaprāptiruktā |
 yayā gāyatryā saccidānandalakṣaṇaṃ brahma prakāśyate |
 tataḥ praṇavasya tatpratipādakatvamantye vakṣyati |
 vyāhṛtyādīnāṃ tatpratipādakatvamāhurācāryāḥ(----)
      bhūḥpadādyā vyāhṛtayo bhūśabdastadi(ḥ sati)varttate |
      tatpadaṃ saditi proktaṃ tanmātratvācca bhūrataḥ ||
      bhūtatvāt kāraṇatvācca bhuvaḥ śabdasya saṅgatiḥ |
      sarvasvīkaraṇāt svātmatayā ca svaritīritam ||
      mahattvācca mahastvācca mahaḥśabdasya saṅgatiḥ |
      tadeva sarvajanatā tasmāt tu vyāhṛtirjanaḥ ||
      tapojñānatayā caiva tathā tāpatayā smṛtam |
      satyaṃ paratvādātmatvādanantajñānataḥ smṛtam ||
      praṇavasya vyāhṛtīnāmataḥ sambandha ucyate |
      akāro bhūrukārastu bhuvo mārṇaḥ svarīritaḥ ||
      bindurmahastathā nādo janaḥ śaktistapaḥ smṛtam |
      śāntiḥ satyamiti proktaṃ yattatparataraṃ padam ||
      atrāpi tatpadaṃ  pūrvaṃ proktaṃ tadanuvarṇyate |
      praṇavasya vyāhṛtīnāṃ gāyatryaikyamathocyate ||
      taddvitīyaikavacanamanenā'khilavastunaḥ |
      sṛṣṭyādikāraṇaṃ tejorūpamādityamaṇḍale ||
      abhidhyeyaṃ parānandaṃ paraṃ brahmā'bhidhīyate |
      yattatsaviturityuktaṃ ṣaṣṭhyekavacanātmakam ||
      dhātoriha  viniṣpannaṃ prāṇiprasavavācakāt |
      sarvāsāṃ prāṇijātīnāmiti prasavituḥ sadā ||
      vareṇyaṃ varaṇīyatvāt  sevanīyatayā tathā |
      bhajanīyatayā sarvaiḥ prārthanīyatayā smṛtam ||
      pūrvasyā'ṣṭākṣarasyaivaṃ vyāhṛtirbhūritīritā |
      pāpasya bharjanādbharge bhaktasnigdhatayā tathā ||
      devasya vṛṣṭidānādiguṇayuktasya nityaśaḥ |
      prabhūtena prakāśena dīpyamānasya vai tathā ||
      dhyai cintāyāmato dhātorniṣpannaṃ dhīmahītyadaḥ|
      nigamādyena divyena vidyārūpeṇa cakṣuṣā ||
      dṛśyo hiraṇmayo deva ādityo nityasaṃsthitaḥ |
      hīnatārahitaṃ tejo yasya syāt sa hiraṇmayaḥ ||
      yaḥ sūkṣmaḥ so'hamityevaṃ cintayāmaḥ sadaiva tu |
      dvitīyāṣṭākṣarasyaivaṃ    vyāhṛtirbhuva  īritā ||
      dhiyo buddhīrmanorasya chāndasatvād ya īritaḥ |
      kṛtaśca liṅgavyatyāsaḥ sūtrāt suptiṅupagrahāt ||
      yattattejo  nirupamaṃ sarvaveda(deva)mayātmakam |
      bhajatāṃ  pāpanāśasya hetubhūtamihocyate ||
      na iti prokta ādeśaḥ ṣaṣṭhyā bahviti cāsmadaḥ |
      tasmādasmākamityarthaḥ prārthanāyāṃ pracodayāt ||
      tṛtīyāṣṭākṣarasyāpi vyāhṛtiḥ svaritīritā |
      evaṃ daśapadānyasyāstrayaścā'ṣṭākṣarāḥ smṛtāḥ ||
      ṣaḍakṣarāśca catvāraḥ syuścatuvīṃśadakṣarāḥ |
      itthaṃbhūtaṃ yadetasya devasya savituvībhoḥ ||
      vareṇyaṃ  bhajatāṃ  pāpavināśanakaraṃ param |
      bharge'smābhirabhidhyātaṃ dhiyastannaḥ pracodayāt ||
      uktaivamatra   gāyatrī  punastacchira  ucyate |
      āpo jyotī rasa iti somāgnyosteja ucyate ||
      tadātmakaṃ jagat sarvaṃ rasastejodvayaṃ smṛtam |
      amṛtaṃ tadanāśitvād bahutvād brahma gadyate ||
      yadānandātmakaṃ brahma  satyajñānādilakṣaṇam |
      tad bhūrbhuvaḥsvarityuktaṃ so'hamityo(ttha)mudāhṛtam ||
      etattu vedasārasya śirastvācchira īritam |
 iti || 1 ||
